 in service of humanity</div></div><div class="flex w-[164px] flex-col gap-[14px]"><img class="h-[100px] w-[100px] shrink-0 object-contain" src="//lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/deploy/flow/ai_official_website/88329/static/image/footer_qr_code.1982b96e.png" alt=""/><div class="whitespace-nowrap text-left text-[14px] leading-[32px] tracking-[0.02em] font-[400] text-[#212121]/50">Join ByteDance Seed</div></div></div><nav class="flex shrink-0 justify-between w-[600px] pc1680:w-[600px]"><div class="flex w-[180px] shrink-0 flex-col gap-[16px]"><div class="h-[20px] text-[16px] leading-[28px] tracking-[0.02em] font-[500] text-[#212121]">Models</div><div class="text-[14px] leading-[32px] tracking-[0.02em] font-[400]"><div><a class="block whitespace-nowrap transition-opacity duration-300 ease-in-out hover:opacity-80 opacity-50" rel="noreferrer" href="/en/seed2_1">Seed2.1</a></div><div><a class="block whitespace-nowrap transition-opacity duration-300 ease-in-out hover:opacity-80 opacity-50" rel="noreferrer" href="/en/seedance2_5">Seedance 2.5</a></div><div><a class="block whitespace-nowrap transition-opacity duration-300 ease-in-out hover:opacity-80 opacity-50" rel="noreferrer" href="/en/seedream5_0_pro">Seedream 5.0 Pro</a></div><div><a class="block whitespace-nowrap transition-opacity duration-300 ease-in-out hover:opacity-80 opacity-50" rel="noreferrer" href="/en/SeedRealtime">SeedRealtime</a></div><div><a class="block whitespace-nowrap transition-opacity duration-300 ease-in-out hover:opacity-80 opacity-50" rel="noreferrer" href="/en/seedaudio1_0">Seed Audio 1.0</a></div><div><a class="block whitespace-nowrap transition-opacity duration-300 ease-in-out hover:opacity-80 opacity-50" rel="noreferrer" href="/en/gr_rl">Seed GR-RL</a></div></div></div><div class="flex w-[180px] shrink-0 flex-col gap-[16px]"><div class="h-[20px] text-[16px] leading-[28px] tracking-[0.02em] font-[500] text-[#212121]">Learn More</div><div class="text-[14px] leading-[32px] tracking-[0.0